.TH ARACNE 1 2000-1月 "dpi_stats" "dpi_stats"
.SH NAME
dpi_stats \- Get the DPI (data processing inequality) filtering statistics of the network.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIdpi_stats(\fBnet\fR as <generic> AracneNetwork);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get the DPI (data processing inequality) filtering statistics of the network.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBnet\fB \fR\- the network that is created via the \fBaracne\fR api. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a single row data frame with the columns: \fBedges_before\fR, \fBedges_after\fR,
 \fBremoved\fR, \fBrescued\fR (the prior protected edges), \fBtriplets\fR and \fBpasses\fR;
 the \fBrescued_high\fR, \fBrescued_medium\fR and \fBrescued_low\fR columns report the
 rescued edges by the prior confidence grade.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
ARACNE
